AIR 4065, "Propeller/Propfan In-Flight Thrust Determination" addresses steady state propeller thrust as applied to aircraft which are usually powered by gas turbine engines.  It includes theory, examples, and methods which have been used.  Specifically two methods are discussed, the "J" or traditional J,C
